+
+## New work in S03 beyond the merge
+
+1. `check_loop_alignment.py` corpus: `tiny_trip_le` (`j <= 3`),
+   `tiny_trip_ne` (`j != 3`), `tiny_trip_mirror` (`3 > j`) — each
+   asserted in both directions (loop survives, stays unpadded) via a
