+
+## Follow-up worked this turn: span-reserve recalibration
+
+The S02 `CCC_RA_LOOP_SPAN_RESERVE=3` claim (+29% chacha20) does NOT
+replicate on S03: 1.626x vs 1.603x default (noise) over 9 paired `-O2`
