+RA-PRESSURE-1 census + `CCC_RA_LOOP_SPAN_RESERVE` calibration
+(`FOLLOWUP-2026-09-07-ARX-CHACHA-RA.md`); ChaCha-vs-GCC 1.6x→1.0x
